# Tracer: the complete domain includes every guard.
# Before: these TRUE goals missed at search_proof despite the actual exclusion lemma.
# fn(k R:k>0,k<0) R {0}={}
# fn_range(fn(k R:k>0,k<0) R {0})={}
# fn(k R:k>0,k<0) {} = {()}
# Now: the shared domain owner checks the typed exclusion forall under inherited
